      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنُوعٌ</span></b>  <i>Perfidious, unfaithful,</i> or <i>treacherous;</i>
one <i>who breaks his compact, contract, covenant,
or the like.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One <i>who turns
away from,</i> or <i>shuns,</i> or <i>avoids, another.</i> (Ibn-
'Abbád, K.)

